[GA Alliance]
[O][L 50.83,5.61 Ironforge]At level 18 or higher, visit *Gerrig Bonegrip* in Ironforge before entering Blackfathom Deeps. Accept [QA971 Knowledge in the Deeps] \\ Tick this off if you are below level 18 or are skipping this detour.
