[O]If you took Knowledge in the Deeps, open the *Pitted Iron Chest* underwater near the area with the turtles. Loot it for *Lorgalis' Manuscript* \\ [QC971,1 Knowledge in the Deeps]
[OC][G 36.71,44.98,5 Darkshore]Go via this waypoint
[OC][G 36.34,45.57 Darkshore]Go to the marked location
