[OC][L 14.23,14.62 Ashenvale][L 37.6,34 Ashenvale][L 15.5,19 Ashenvale]Start looking for a group for BFD \\ Grind *Furbolgs* north of Astranaar for *Wool Cloth* while you assemble a group \\ (Skip if you are already in Blackfathom Deeps)
[OC]Kill *Fallenroot Rogues*, *Fallenroot Satyrs*, *Blackfathom Oracles* and *Blackfathom Tide Priestesses*. Loot them for their *Corrupted Brain Stems* \\ You may also loot *Corrupted Brain Stems* once inside the Instance \\ [QC1275,1 Researching the Corruption]
