Talk to *Argent Guard Thaelrid* \\ Turn in [QT1198 In Search of Thaelrid] \\ Accept [QA1200 Blackfathom Villainy]
[O]If you took Knowledge in the Deeps, open the *Pitted Iron Chest* underwater near the area with the turtles. Loot it for *Lorgalis' Manuscript* \\ [QC971,1 Knowledge in the Deeps]
[OC]Kill all of the *Twilight's Hammer*. Loot them for their *Twilight Pendants* \\ [QC1199,1 Twilight Falls]
