Kill all of the *Twilight's Hammer*. Loot them for their *Twilight Pendants* \\ [QC1199,1 Twilight Falls]
Kill *Nagas* and *Satyrs*. Loot them for their *Corrupted Brain Stems* \\ If you haven't completed this quest yet, click on the altar at the end of the dungeon to teleport you to the entrance. The mobs outside of the instance can also drop it. \\ [QC1275,1 Researching the Corruption]
